===A3_S5_D2===
// talk to chione 
Chione: There you are! The calf wanted me to give you this. #portrait:ChioneLaugh
Noelle: Oh, are these earrings? #portrait:NoelleShocked
Chione: Yes! Monsteratops tend to wear these, with more decorative materials as they age. #portrait:ChioneLaugh
Chione: It's a sign of appreciation for your help. #portrait:ChioneLaugh
Narrator: After rambling a little, Chione finally remembers— 
Chione: Right! You were curious about how Thavmia prepares for the floods, weren't you? #portrait:ChioneNormal
Chione: In the month leading up to the flood, the settlements around the base of the island gradually gather their possessions and pack them into carts. #portrait:ChioneNormal
Chione: There's another settlement living in the mountains, you see — and as generations came to pass, they've made progress exploring the caverns around their home. #portrait:ChioneNormal
Chione: They work year-long to maintain and expand the tunnels, so that when the time came, the island can file in and wait out the floods. #portrait:ChioneNormal
Noelle: How would you know when to come out? And how are the caves sealed? #portrait:NoelleSmallSmile
Amelia: Ah, I know this part. #portrait:AmeliaHappy
Amelia: The Ichthyos and a handful of volunteers stay outside when the flood comes. There's a communication network between the inside and out. #portrait:AmeliaNeutral
Chione: Yes, but those who stay outside, even if they're Ichthyos… face a pretty big risk. #portrait:ChioneHm
Narrator: You can imagine. Even on clear days, just a strong gust of wind could be deadly to boats off-shore. 
Chione: And this year, there's talk of the Krakenfolk joining the Ichthyos outside, since they're used to living near the waterfall, as well. #portrait:ChioneHm
Narrator: Chione gestures to you with a smile.
Chione: Krakenfolk have incredible physical strength, after all. Though I didn't know just one of you could move ruin blocks! #portrait:ChioneNormal
Noelle: Haha… I was surprised the first time, too. #portrait:NoelleBigSmile
Noelle: (Maybe sometime later, I can ask for more information about the Krakenfolk, too.) #portrait:NoelleSmallSmile
Noelle: (It sounds like there are a lot of others like me.) #portrait:NoelleSmallSmile
Chione: Oh, right! Let's go chat with Silas before Oren gets into too much trouble. #portrait:ChioneNormal
Noelle: Did he say something wrong? #portrait:NoelleShocked
Chione: Most of it was traditional. Just that small slip-up about Noah and Elio, uh… #portrait:ChioneNormal
Amelia: Having a moment? #portrait:AmeliaSilly
Narrator: Chione chuckles. 
Chione: Yes, that. #portrait:ChioneLaugh
-> DONE